---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const storyImages = {
hero:'/images/our-story/gear-moto-foundation-our-story-rider-sunset-hero.jpg',
people:'/images/our-story/gear-moto-foundation-rider-community-real-people.jpg',
purpose:'/images/our-story/gear-moto-foundation-motorcycle-community-bigger-purpose.jpg',
support:'/images/our-story/gear-moto-foundation-riders-helping-riders-support-in-action.jpg',
tomorrow:'/images/our-story/gear-moto-foundation-rider-community-stronger-tomorrow.jpg'
};
---
<Base title="Our Story" description="Discover GEAR Moto Foundation's mission, vision and values: riders helping riders through motorcycle safety, education, assistance and recovery.">

<section id="story-mission" class="story-intro-section"><div class="wrap story-intro-grid"><div><span class="section-label">WHY WE STARTED</span><h1>DRIVEN BY RIDERS.<br/><span>BUILT FOR RIDERS.</span></h1><h2>Our Mission</h2><p>GEAR Moto Foundation is being developed to strengthen the motorcycle community by expanding access to protective riding gear and education, promoting responsible road safety, connecting riders with practical guidance and services, and building need-based recovery support for motorcyclists and families facing serious motorcycle accidents.</p><a class="text-arrow" href="/programs/">Explore the four pillars ↗</a></div><figure class="story-inline-art"><img src={storyImages.hero} alt="Illustrative GEAR rider at a mountain overlook with Our Story lettering" fetchpriority="high" width="1672" height="941"/><figcaption>Our Story — concept illustration</figcaption></figure></div></section>

<section class="story-content-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="story-content-grid"><div><span class="section-label">OUR VISION</span><h2>NO RIDER SHOULD FACE THE ROAD AHEAD ALONE.</h2><p>A motorcycle community where safer riding is more accessible, riders look out for one another, and no rider facing a serious crash has to navigate the aftermath alone.</p></div><div><span class="section-label">WHO WE SERVE</span><h2>ALL BIKES.<br/>ALL RIDERS.</h2><p><strong>All Bikes. All Riders.</strong> We intend to serve an open-ended rider community, not a membership club, dealership, or fundraising vehicle for preselected individuals. Program assistance will be governed by charitable purpose, documented need and objective standards—not friendship, brand, sponsor, or club affiliation.</p></div></div><div class="story-photo-pair"><figure class="story-inline-art"><img src={storyImages.people} alt="GEAR riders showing solidarity at sunset, Real People concept" loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941"/><figcaption>Real People — illustrative concept</figcaption></figure><figure class="story-inline-art"><img src={storyImages.purpose} alt="GEAR-branded motorcycle riders on a scenic road, A Bigger Purpose concept" loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941"/><figcaption>A Bigger Purpose — illustrative concept</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="story-values-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="story-values-heading"><span class="section-label">WHAT GUIDES US</span><h2>OUR VALUES.<br/><span>OUR COMMITMENT.</span></h2></div><div class="story-values-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Riders Helping Riders</h3><p>Community connection paired with fair, objective charitable assistance.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Safety Without Preaching</h3><p>Equipment, skill and better decisions without shaming.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Access</h3><p>Lower barriers to protective equipment, education and recovery resources.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Accountability</h3><p>Sound stewardship, conflict safeguards and meaningful reporting.</p></article><article><span>05</span><h3>Keep Moving</h3><p>Recovery supports stability and resilience without pressuring anyone to ride again.</p></article></div></div></section>

<section class="story-governance-section"><div class="wrap story-governance-grid"><div><span class="section-label">HOW WE INTEND TO OPERATE</span><h2>FOUNDER-LED.<br/><span>BOARD-GOVERNED.</span></h2></div><div><p>Phillip “Wade” Gale is the founder and proposed President &amp; Executive Director. The draft operating model places day-to-day management with the executive leader and fiduciary oversight with an independent board. Final appointments and governance rights remain subject to incorporation, board action and legal review.</p><figure class="story-inline-art"><img src={storyImages.support} alt="Support in Action, GEAR rider handshake illustration" loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941"/><figcaption>Support in Action — illustrative concept</figcaption></figure><div class="program-callout"><strong>Organizational status:</strong> GEAR's formation, governing documents and charitable recognition must be verified before publication as completed facts. This page describes the current development plan.</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/leadership/">Meet Our Leadership</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="/programs/">Explore Our Mission</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="/impact/">Transparency Approach</a></div></div></div></section>

<section class="story-final-cta"><div class="wrap story-ending-grid"><div><span class="section-label">ALL BIKES. ALL RIDERS.</span><h2>HELP SHAPE WHAT<br/><span>COMES NEXT.</span></h2><p>Our programs are being developed. Discover how you can help create a stronger and more connected riding community.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/volunteer/">Get Involved ↗</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="/contact/">Connect With GEAR ↗</a></div></div><figure class="story-inline-art"><img src={storyImages.tomorrow} alt="GEAR-branded community at sunset with A Stronger Tomorrow lettering" loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941"/><figcaption>A Stronger Tomorrow — illustrative vision</figcaption></figure></div></section>
</Base>